  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xE9;ponse humanitaire d&#x2019;urgence &#xE0; l&#x2019;afflux des Refugies Maliens dans la r&#xE9;gion de Hodh Chargui &#x2013; Mauritanie</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide emergency humanitarian assistance to meet the immediate needs of newly arrived Malian refugees in the Hodh Chargui region of Mauritania, as well as host populations. UNHCR project will strengthen community mechanisms to identify persons with specific needs, at-risk children and women, survivors of gender-based violence, and persons in extremely vulnerable situations, and will reinforce support mechanisms for the most vulnerable populations, among other activities. The project provides life-saving assistance to 15,000 people, including 3,712 women, 8,851 children, and including 360 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
